<problem>

<selectFromSequence name="a" hide="true" step=" 3" from="3" to="33" />
<selectFromSequence name="b" hide="true" from="2" to="6" />
<selectFromSequence name="c" hide="true" from="1" to="9" />
<math name="AA" hide="true" simplify="full">$a e^$c</math>
<math name="kk" hide="true" simplify="full">$b</math>

Write the function <m>f(x)=$a e^{ $b x+$c }</m> in the form <m>f(x)=Ae^{kx}</m>. <nbsp />  What are the values of the parameters <m>A</m> and <m>k</m>?

<p> <m>A=</m> <mathInput name="input1" /> , <m>k=</m> <mathInput name="input2" />
</p>

<answer>
  <award matchpartial="true" referencesAreResponses="$input1 $input2"><when> 
    <mathList>
      $input1 $input2
    </mathList>
    =
    <mathList>$AA $kk</mathList>
  </when> </award>
</answer>

<solution>
<m>A=$a e^$c</m>, <m>k=$b </m>
</solution>

</problem>
